            "review_title": "Review at Beef Steak Titi",
            "review_text": "JunnieVN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam78 contributions\n1\nDO NOT come to this place\nJul 2019 • Couples\nMy friend and I went to this \"restaurant \" which specialized in Steak ( so-called \"French\" style )\nWe end up return one dish, Tuna in melted cheese dressing.\nWe also end up had to eat up one Steak dish which was - the Steak itself - at the ROOM temperature. \nYes - We had it right - room temperature for steak and dressing. Not Hot, we did not even know if it was grilled or fried ..\nAnd the potatoes? OMG cold as the air cond. \n\nService was really bad.\n\nDo not try this, do not come to this place, what a waste. \n\nThe taste was terrible, even me I am not the Master Chief but I felt like Kitchen Hell\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 5, 2019",
